{
  "name": "search_is_retried_with_the_same_idempotency_key",
  "description": "Search reads Idempotency-Key: the same key on the same request, from the same credential on the same UTC day, is charged once. So a search that may have reached the server is retried, carrying the key of its first attempt.",
